-- ============================================================================
-- Vee platform — 0004: seed data
-- Ported verbatim from the original static site's PLAN_ITEMS / product
-- descriptions (js/i18n.js) plus the platform's feature-flag catalogue and
-- Vee's own hardware product line, so the rebuilt platform launches with
-- real, correct content rather than lorem ipsum.
-- ============================================================================

